ent-KamertonReactorCore = Kamerton reactor core
    .desc = The heart of the Kamerton reactor. Everything else is assembled around it.
ent-KamertonStableFuelArray = Kamerton stable fuel array
    .desc = Holds up to four super-energy cells for the Kamerton reactor.
ent-KamertonUnstableFuelArray = Kamerton unstable fuel array
    .desc = Holds up to four unstable super-energy cells for the Kamerton reactor.
ent-KamertonSynchronizer = Kamerton synchronizer
    .desc = Tunes stable and unstable cells to one frequency. Each tuned pair gives 50 kW, up to four pairs.
ent-KamertonHeatSink = Kamerton heat sink
    .desc = Pumps gas from its inlet pipe to its outlet pipe and dumps the reactor heat into it. Must be linked into the reactor.
ent-KamertonRadiator = Kamerton radiator
    .desc = Soaks up reactor heat and slowly hands it to the gas in its pipe.
ent-KamertonSuppressor = Kamerton suppressor
    .desc = One segment of the suppressor ring around the Kamerton reactor. A broken ring leaks redspace.
ent-KamertonPowerUnit = Kamerton power unit
    .desc = Feeds the reactor output into the high-voltage network. Stands in the suppressor ring on an HV cable.
ent-KamertonReactorCoreFlatpack = Kamerton reactor core flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a Kamerton reactor core. Unpack it with a multitool.
ent-KamertonStableFuelArrayFlatpack = Kamerton stable fuel array flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a Kamerton stable fuel array. Unpack it with a multitool.
ent-KamertonUnstableFuelArrayFlatpack = Kamerton unstable fuel array flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a Kamerton unstable fuel array. Unpack it with a multitool.
ent-KamertonSynchronizerFlatpack = Kamerton synchronizer flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a Kamerton synchronizer. Unpack it with a multitool.
ent-KamertonHeatSinkFlatpack = Kamerton heat sink flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a Kamerton heat sink. Unpack it with a multitool.
ent-KamertonRadiatorFlatpack = Kamerton radiator flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a Kamerton radiator. Unpack it with a multitool.
ent-KamertonSuppressorFlatpack = Kamerton suppressor flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a Kamerton suppressor. Unpack it with a multitool.
ent-KamertonPowerUnitFlatpack = Kamerton power unit flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a Kamerton power unit. Unpack it with a multitool.
ent-KamertonControlModuleFlatpack = Kamerton control module flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a Kamerton control module. Unpack it with a multitool.
